{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"zettel.20260505180231","title":"Cloud GPU rental sering lebih rasional daripada beli 4090 untuk penggunaan eksperimental","desc":"Kalau lo belum rutin pakai local LLM ratusan jam, sewa 4090 di cloud bisa lebih murah daripada capex dan listrik.","updated":1777985390780,"created":1777983878210,"tags":["zettel","hardware","cloud","cost"],"custom":{},"fname":"zettel.20260505180231","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"ed47da6d96ec58fa2736abe0bd825234","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260505180231","id":"zettel.20260505180231","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.zettel","alias":"zettel","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.zettel"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260505180231","id":"zettel.20260505180231","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.hardware","alias":"hardware","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.hardware"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260505180231","id":"zettel.20260505180231","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.cloud","alias":"cloud","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.cloud"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260505180231","id":"zettel.20260505180231","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.cost","alias":"cost","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.cost"}},{"from":{"fname":"zettel.moc.local-llm","id":"zettel.moc.local-llm","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":3,"offset":1316},"end":{"line":22,"column":28,"offset":1341},"indent":[]},"value":"zettel.20260505180231"}],"anchors":{},"children":[],"parent":"zettel","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"cloud-gpu-rental-sering-lebih-rasional-daripada-beli-4090-untuk-penggunaan-eksperimental\">Cloud GPU rental sering lebih rasional daripada beli 4090 untuk penggunaan eksperimental<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#cloud-gpu-rental-sering-lebih-rasional-daripada-beli-4090-untuk-penggunaan-eksperimental\"></a></h1>\n<p>Untuk eksperimen local LLM, batas ambang keputusan biasanya bukan sekadar harga GPU. Kalau penggunaan lo masih di bawah beberapa puluh jam per bulan, cloud rental bisa lebih rasional.</p>\n<p>Contoh:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>RTX 4090 Secure Cloud sekitar $0.69/jam,</li>\n<li>Community Cloud sekitar $0.34/jam.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Kalau lo pakai 10 jam/bulan, itu sekitar Rp110 ribu; kalau lo pakai 50 jam, sekitar Rp550 ribu.</p>\n<p>Dengan target penggunaan awal, sewa cloud membantu menghindari biaya upfront PSU, case, listrik, dan maintenance.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #a03623;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.zettel\">zettel</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">hardware (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">cloud (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">cost (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.moc.local-llm\">MOC Local LLM dan Copilot agent</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"hea